chapter.v:
Now Joab 


was in, 


command of all the army of Israel; and Benaiah the son of Jehoiada was in command of the Cherethites and the Pelethites;

and Adoram 


was in, 


charge of the forced labor; and Jehoshaphat the son of Ahilud was the recorder;

and Sheva 


was secretary;, 


and Zadok and Abiathar were priests;
